{"script":"s_4_13_2","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"幽灵雅拉德","text":"[show]吵闹声？噢，你们说的是那个孩子啊。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]孩子？你说的是谁？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"幽灵雅拉德","text":"[show]是这样的，前几天禁林里来了一个小孩的怨灵。他非常调皮，喜欢到处飞来飞去，你们说的噪音应该是他弄出来的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]是什么熊孩子，变成怨灵还喜欢在半夜制造噪音？等我把他抓起来，我要狠狠的打他的屁股！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"幽灵雅拉德","text":"[show]其实那个怨灵的神志并不清醒，这么闹腾恐怕也不完全是他的错。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"幽灵雅拉德","text":"[show]而且……你恐怕不容易抓住他。你们前几天也来过几次什么也没发现对吧，就是因为他听到你们的动静早就飞走了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]那……有什么办法抓住他吗？噪声对你们幽灵来说可能没什么影响，但对我们来说那可是无比痛苦的折磨啊。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"幽灵雅拉德","text":"[show]这个嘛……我有个想法，你们可以用他喜欢的食物把他印出来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"幽灵雅拉德","text":"[show]我和他沟通过几次，他说过自己喜欢的食物是什么……松茸鲜汤，你们听说过这个名字吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]当然听说过，我以前就非常喜欢吃这种松茸汤，超级好吃的！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"幽灵雅拉德","text":"[show]那就好了，你们可以弄一碗这样的，把那个幽灵引出来。然后你们再趁机抓住他，让他的神志恢复清醒就好啦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]好主意啊，我们这就去准备！那食材的事情……可以拜托你们两位吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]我想想……想要做出做出松茸鲜汤，一共需要一份黑森林松茸干，一份兽肉和一份野菜。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嘿嘿，好咧，交给我们吧。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"你知道最近喧嚣的原因吗？"}